          "items": [
            "Welcome to No Spooky Days—a brand-new luxury home just a 3-minute stroll from Spooky Lane Beach Access! With a private pool, TWO 6-seater golf carts, and space for up to 16 guests, this spacious coastal retreat is perfect for group getaways. The home offers stylish design, high-end finishes, and walkability to Gulf Place, making it a dream stay on 30A.<br><br>☼ 5 Bedrooms + carriage house suite<br>☼ Sleeps 16<br>☼ Private pool<br>☼ TWO 6-seater golf carts<br>☼ Walk to Spooky Lane Beach Access (3 minutes)<br>☼ Minutes from Gulf Place shops, restaurants, and live music<br>☼ 6 full bathrooms + 1 half bathroom<br>☼ Double laundry rooms (1 upstairs, 1 downstairs)<br>☼ Large covered patios on both floors<br>☼ Full kitchen with modern appliances<br>☼ Outdoor grill + plenty of dining space<br><br>Layout & Sleeping Arrangements:<br>☼ Main Floor: King suite + en-suite bathroom (ideal for those who prefer no stairs)<br>☼ Second Floor: 2 King suites, each with en-suite bathrooms<br>☼ Second Floor: Double Queen room with attached bathroom<br>☼ Second Floor: Bunk room with 2 twin-over-twin bunks, private bath, and game table<br>☼ Private carriage house suite (above the garage): King bed, mini kitchenette, private bath<br><br>Outdoor Perks:<br>☼ Private pool<br>☼ TWO 6-seater golf carts for easy cruising around 30A<br>☼ Large covered patios on both floors<br>☼ Outdoor grill + dining space for meals in the sunshine<br><br>Home Amenities:<br>☼ Two 6-seater golf carts<br>☼ 10 beach chairs<br>☼ 2 beach umbrellas<br>☼ 1 beach cart<br>☼ 2 boogie boards<br><br>Closest Beach Access Point:<br>☼ Spooky Lane Beach Access<br>→ 92 S Spooky Lane, Santa Rosa Beach, FL 32459<br>→ Bike parking only<br>→ No vehicle parking<br>→ No restrooms or showers<br><br>Guest Access:<br>☼ Full access to the main home and carriage house suite<br>☼ Private pool<br>☼ TWO 6-seater golf carts for cruising<br>☼ Driveway parking for up to 6 vehicles<br>☼ Spooky Lane Beach Access—just a 3-minute walk away<br><br>30A Beach Stays provides a few starter essentials to kick off your stay:<br>We’ve stocked the home with starter essentials:<br>☼ Full Bath: Travel Size shampoo, conditioner, hand/face bar, massage body bar, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Half Bath: Hand soap, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Kitchen: 2 dishwasher pods, 2 laundry pods, 1 sponge, small dish soap, 1 roll of paper towels<br>☼ Trash Bags: A few liners per bathroom & kitchen bins<br>If you're staying longer or need more of anything, let us know — we're happy to recommend the closest grocery or convenience stores!<br><br>☼ A signed rental agreement is required before check-in. This agreement only needs to be signed by the guest who booked.<br>☼ A golf cart agreement must also be signed before we can share the key code for the golf carts. You’ll receive a link to this agreement in your check-in message.<br>☼ Guests ages 18–24 with no one in the group over 25 will be required to pay a security deposit.<br><br>For your safety, we have exterior cameras that record audio and video only when motion is detected.<br>☼ EXTERIOR USE ONLY ☼<br><br>DWE7605410",
